# <type>[(optional scope)]: <description>
#
# [optional body]
#
# [optional footer(s)]
#
# =======================================================================
#
# Types:
# feat      -> new feature
# fix       -> bug fix
# docs      -> documentation only
# style     -> formatting (no code change)
# refactor  -> code change without fixing a bug nor adding a feature
# perf      -> performance improvement(s)
# test      -> adding or updating tests
# build     -> build system or dependencies
# ci        -> CI/CD changes
# chore     -> other (maintenance, tooling, cleanup)
# revert    -> revert previous commit(s)
#
# =======================================================================
#
# Optional body: (describe the 'what' & 'why', not 'how')
#
# - explain the context or problem
# - describe reasoning behind the change
# - mention alternatives if relevant
#
# =======================================================================
#
# Optional footer(s):
#
# BREAKING CHANGE: <description>
# Closes: #123
# Fixes: #456
# Refs: #789
#
# More information on: https://www.conventionalcommits.org/en/v1.0.0/
